# # /fornmed/
#
# Persistent identifiers for Fornmed, a database of sources for the prehistory
# and Middle Ages of Sweden and the Nordic countries: https://fornmed.se/
#
# Every path redirects with 303 to the same path under https://fornmed.se/,
# which answers with the record's web page for a browser and RDF for a program,
# depending on the Accept header. The query string (format=ttl) is kept.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Magnus Kolsjö
# GitHub username: MagnusKolsjo

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://fornmed.se/$1 [R=303,L]
